SmartFood ERP – Smart Manufacturing & Inventory Management System

About the Project

SmartFood ERP is a Django-based Enterprise Resource Planning application designed to manage food production, inventory, sales, billing, and business reports.

Modules

- User Authentication
- Product Management
- Inventory Management
- Production Management
- Sales Management
- Billing and Invoices
- Reports and Analytics

Technologies

- Python
- Django
- HTML5
- CSS3
- Bootstrap
- SQLite

